# Network at a glance

kpi Network utilization | 91.8% | 166,100 of 181,000 parcels/day | neutral

kpi Headroom | 14,900 parcels/day
kpi Over capacity | Memphis | +2,200 parcels/day | bad
kpi Tightest after Memphis | Tulsa | 2,400 headroom | bad
kpi Seasonal hires | 640 | 210 for Memphis

The network as a whole has room, but it sits in the wrong place. Memphis is forecast 2,200 parcels a day over capacity and Tulsa has only 2,400 of headroom.

